nt-evil/watch?locale=IN","rent":[{"logo_path":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png","provider_id":2,"provider_name":"Apple TV Store","display_priority":4},{"logo_path":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png","provider_id":10,"provider_name":"Amazon Video","display_priority":37}],"buy":[{"logo_path":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png","provider_id":2,"provider_name":"Apple TV Store","display_priority":4}]},"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1423191-resident-evil/watch?locale=US","buy":[{"logo_path":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png","provider_id":10,"provider_name":"Amazon Video","display_priority":9},{"logo_path":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png","provider_id":2,"provider_name":"Apple TV Store","display_priority":10},{"logo_path":"/wpOt6x0dRxTrIzuBosto4LGd7E9.png","provider_id":7,"provider_name":"Fandango At Home","display_priority":40}],"rent":[{"logo_path":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png","provider_id":10,"provider_name":"Amazon Video","display_priority":9},{"logo_path":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png","provider_id":2,"provider_name":"Apple TV Store","display_priority":10},{"logo_path":"/wpOt6x0dRxTrIzuBosto4LGd7E9.png","provider_id":7,"provider_name":"Fandango At Home","display_priority":40}]}}},"alternative_titles":{"titles":[{"iso_3166_1":"JP","title":"Biohazard","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"TH","title":"เรสซิเดนท์ อีวิล","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"AR","title":"Resident Evil: Noche cero","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"IN","title":"ᱨᱮᱥᱤᱰᱮᱱᱴ ᱤᱵᱷᱟᱞ","type":"Santali"},{"iso_3166_1":"LT","title":"Absoliutus blogis","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"CL","title":"Resident Evil: Noche cero","type":""}]},"reviews":{"page":1,"results":[{"author":"magik_7o","author_details":{"name":"","username":"magik_7o","avatar_path":null,"rating":null},"content":"This film is good, i really like the cast and the trame. This film have some problem in the second part of the film. The finale scene is bad. I can accepted that if you tell me there is going to be  another movie. But this film is still good.","created_at":"2026-09-19T15:19:30Z","id":"6aaea8027d78cf7d7666f72e","updated_at":"2026-09-19T19:53:42Z","url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/review/6aaea8027d78cf7d7666f72e"},{"author":"Nick","author_details":{"name":"Nick","username":"NSWMGN","avatar_path":"/e5Fd1R8Ha2eGBwzcpZjfw9XOHIe.jpg","rating":9},"content":"Zach Cregger takes Capcom's zombie-outbreak survival horror and does exactly what a video game adaptation should do: capture the *feeling* of the games instead of slavishly recreating cutscenes. Rather than shoehorning in Leon or Claire, he builds an original story around Bryan (Austin Abrams), a hapless medical courier who stumbles into an outbreak near Raccoon City — and it works because Cregger clearly loves this world rather than just licensing it. The tense, blood-soaked gore is offset by moments of levity and humor, that signature Cregger tonal whiplash from Barbarian and Weapons — genuinely unsettling dread punctuated by \"what the fuck\" comedic beats that shouldn't work together but do. It's easily the best live-action Resident Evil yet. Only real complaint: the ending. Hard swerve that undercuts the tension built for two hours. Docking half a star for that alone — everything before it is a near-perfect survival horror movie.","created_at":"2026-09-20T06:55:51Z","id":"6aaf837733ff6bc5d9064ac1","updated_at":"2026-09-20T06:55:51Z","url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/review/6aaf837733ff6bc5d9064ac1"},{"author":"michaelgtr","author_details":{"name":"","username":"michaelgtr","avatar_path":null,"rating":null},"content":"RE? NO, a generic comedy horror.\r\n\r\n It's really hard to accept that 'comedy horror' genre is a thing, like this one. \r\n\r\nA Uber courier (with no car) sets out to make a delivery-sparking uproarious laughter in what looks like a festival of stupidity-and ends up dead. \r\n\r\nRE (game saga) centers on an imminent pathological outbreak that triggers a massive socio-economic transformation of society. A group attempts to expose the details regarding the responsible corporation-which defends itself by weaponizing the outbreak-thereby unleashing an exodus and a struggle for survival of the fittest. \r\n\r\nThis movie has nothing about that, just a generic pandemic BS from a messenger perspective.","created_at":"2026-09-20T15:43:19Z","id":"6aafff1600014ffbe29763a2","updated_at":"2026-09-20T17:02:33Z","url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/review/6aafff1600014ffbe29763a2"}],"total_pages":1,"total_results":12}}
